                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Munro</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-11-08T14:00:00-05:45"><hi rendition="#italic">November 8,
                                1927—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 3:50 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>323. Aguado took office on the Claims Commission yesterday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Munro</hi></signed></closer>
